# 🔐 WORKFLOW COMPLIANCE ENFORCER

## PURPOSE:
Prevent rule violations by enforcing mandatory rules review before any code modifications.

## TRIGGER PHRASES:
If the user asks to modify, edit, update, change, or create ANY file, this protocol activates:

### ACTIVATION TRIGGERS:
- "edit this file"
- "modify the CSS"
- "change the header"
- "update the component"
- "fix this issue"
- "add this feature" 
- "create a new..."
- Any request involving code changes

